 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Warm the oil in a large pot or deep skillet on medium.</li><li>Drop in the cumin seeds and give them about 30 seconds to sizzle and open up.</li><li>Add:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>onion <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-n=\"1\">1</span> medium</span></li><li>fresh ginger <span class=\"amt\">a thumb-size piece</span></li><li>garlic <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"4\" data-b=\"6\" data-f=\"clove|cloves\" data-n=\"3\">4–6 cloves</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Let the onion go soft and see-through, 5–7 minutes — give it the full time.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "label_html": "<span>medium</span>",
    "off": false
   },
