  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>When it boils, drop the heat to medium-low.</li><li>Add:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>chickpeas <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-f=\"can|cans\" data-n=\"1\">2 cans</span> (2 × ~<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"400\" data-s=\"0\">400 g</span>)</span></li><li>sweet potato <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-n=\"1\">1</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Stir so everything is coated, then simmer 15–20 minutes, until a fork slides into the sweet potato.</li><li>Loosen with water if it thickens too much. It’s ready when the sweet potato is soft, the chickpeas are hot and the sauce has body.</li></ul>",
